# The dedicated server image's build context (round net4c): an allow-list. BuildKit, Docker's builder since 23.0, reads
# this file for the Dockerfile beside it in place of a .dockerignore at the context's root; the legacy builder
# (DOCKER_BUILDKIT=0) does not, and would send the whole working copy (Game-Data/, .build/, targets: hundreds of GB).
# Only what `cargo build --locked -p avalanche-server` reads goes in: cargo loads every workspace member to build one,
# then compiles the server and the crates it depends on, whole, with the files they embed. A new workspace crate or embedded file under the
# server needs its line below: the build names the file it misses.
*
!Engine/Cargo.toml
!Engine/Cargo.lock
!Engine/.cargo/config.toml
# every member's and patched crate's manifest and the files its targets are found by (cargo loads them all to build
# one, and a declared target's file must exist even when it is not built): crate roots, binaries, examples, tests,
# benches and build scripts, as cargo looks for them
!Engine/*/*/Cargo.toml
!Engine/*/*/build.rs
!Engine/*/*/src/lib.rs
!Engine/*/*/src/main.rs
!Engine/*/*/src/bin/*.rs
!Engine/*/*/src/bin/*/main.rs
!Engine/*/*/examples/*.rs
!Engine/*/*/examples/*/main.rs
!Engine/*/*/tests/*.rs
!Engine/*/*/tests/*/main.rs
!Engine/*/*/benches/*.rs
!Engine/*/*/benches/*/main.rs
# the server and its workspace crates (`cargo tree -e normal,build -p avalanche-server`), the patched netcode
!Engine/apps/avalanche-server/src
!Engine/crates/ssx-assets/src
!Engine/crates/ssx-content/src
!Engine/crates/ssx-core/src
!Engine/crates/ssx-files/src
!Engine/crates/ssx-formats/src
!Engine/crates/ssx-gameplay/src
!Engine/crates/ssx-lua/src
!Engine/crates/ssx-net/src
!Engine/crates/ssx-net-lan/src
!Engine/crates/ssx-net-ops/src
!Engine/crates/ssx-net-portmap/src
!Engine/crates/ssx-net-proto/src
!Engine/crates/ssx-physics/src
!Engine/crates/ssx-rules/src
!Engine/crates/ssx-script/src
!Engine/vendor/bevy_replicon-*
!Engine/vendor/lightyear*
# the files they embed (include_str!, include_bytes!): the server's tables, ssx-assets' markers, templates, the
# front end's English strings and the script API's definitions
!Engine/assets/server/disc-hashes.tsv
!Engine/assets/server/server-files.tsv
!Engine/assets/markers
!Engine/assets/templates
!Engine/assets/fe/strings/eng_us.json
!Engine/crates/ssx-script/defs
# the image's notices
!Engine/assets/server/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt
